A caption bucket key keeps a symbol and drops a comment

```
||
^ Fig :smile: #: a

||
^ Fig #: b
.
<table>
  <caption>Fig :smile: 1: a</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<table>
  <caption>Fig 1: b</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
||
^ Fig #: a

||
^ Fig {#c#} #: b
.
<table>
  <caption>Fig 1: a</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<table>
  <caption>Fig <span class="critic-comment">c</span> 2: b</caption>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
